$.","En":"Calculate the increase: $100\\times\\frac{25}{100}=25$."},{"Ar":"أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $100+25=125$.","En":"Add the increase to the original price: $100+25=125$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$125$","En":"$125$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.","En":"Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price."},"FormulaLatex":"P_{\\mathrm{new}}=P\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100}\\right)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$100+100\\times\\frac{25}{100}=100+25=125$","En":"$100+100\\times\\frac{25}{100}=100+25=125$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{125-100}{100}\\times100=25$","En":"$\\frac{125-100}{100}\\times100=25$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 26، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 25.","En":"This price differs from the original by 26, but the required increase is 25."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 28، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 25.","En":"This price differs from the original by 28, but the required increase is 25."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 23، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 25.","En":"This price differs from the original by 23, but the required increase is 25."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. احسب الزيادة: $100\times\frac{25}{100}=25$.

2. أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $100+25=125$.

$100+100\times\frac{25}{100}=100+25=125$

$125$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{125-100}{100}\times100=25$

لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.$mw$,$mw$The new price equals the original price plus the increase.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. Calculate the increase: $100\times\frac{25}{100}=25$.

2. Add the increase to the original price: $100+25=125$.

$100+100\times\frac{25}{100}=100+25=125$

$125$ Currency units

$\frac{125-100}{100}\times100=25$

